        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            KingSmith built the format and named it, and the word escaped into general use — so
            <strong class="text-white">most people searching for a walking pad are searching for a
            trademark</strong>. The genuine advantage is that this is a real product company in a
            category full of storefronts.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Pay the premium if you want the machine working in five years, since
            <a href="/treadmill-repair/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">a controller board only exists if someone still makes one</a>.
            Buy on specification if you expect to replace it anyway. Either way, check the minimum
            speed first and
            <a href="/how-often-to-lubricate-treadmill/" class="text-[#5AA9FF] font-bold no-underline">lubricate it from month one</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
